OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright  
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.    
OL,7,FMild and windy with occasional rain on 
OL,8,FMonday, drier in the east. Mainly dry  
OL,9,Fand bright on Tuesday.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
